# ALLOWLIST for the devcontainer build context (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root .dockerignore).
#
# Everything is excluded, then exactly what the stages read is re-admitted:
# the toolchain's inputs (both modules' go.mod/go.sum and the tool installer
# with its pins), and for the integration stage the root package's and
# providertest's non-test sources, the integration suite and the two scripts
# it runs. Each stage COPYs its own part by name, so the integration image
# does not carry the toolchain's. Neither image can carry .git, local.mk, a
# stray credentials file, the repository-local tool cache (bin/) or a coverage
# profile — whatever lands in the checkout tomorrow, it is excluded until
# someone admits it here on purpose.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!test/buildgates/go.mod
!test/buildgates/go.sum
!scripts/lib.sh
!scripts/tool.sh
!scripts/tool-pins.sh
!scripts/install-tools.sh
!*.go
!providertest/*.go
!test/integration/**/*.go
!build/docker/devcontainer/run-integration-tests.sh
!scripts/coverage-gate.sh
# The root package's and providertest's own unit tests are not part of this
# suite and are not compiled by it.
*_test.go
providertest/*_test.go
!test/integration/**/*_test.go
